# S8-4 (QUALIFICATION): the staggered trigger under the exactness policy at EIGHT users, on c2-packed-tp4-8-gate: users arrive 30 s apart at the matrix's
# eight lengths (4096 out, EOS on), so each later prefill runs AFTER padded and mixed packed rounds in either block (the prefill-after-replay trigger,
# now with two blocks and a half-empty block), and every user's text is compared with its solo arm under the strict policy (one rerun on a first
# divergence), plus the padded-probe arm.
# READ (c2-gate-summary.json, the staggered arm's server.log): the users whose 'Prefilling 1 user(s)' line FOLLOWS a padded or mixed packed round in
# either block, each IDENTICAL to solo = the trigger is exact; the '[PINDIAG] four-card prefill programs=' lines (a B-A-W above zero names an unwarmed
# shape).
# Duration (estimate): 60-120 min, the gate's worst case (a rerun of both judged arms) up to the step budget. Stop rule: any non-identical user stops
# the window; read each problem line before calling it (the plan's other checks can fail for reasons that are not the trigger).
# SHIP WINDOW: strict.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4-seats8 SHIP window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/seats8 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN.
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. Every value is final.
# ORDER.txt says the order, each job's stop rule, its minutes and the GO rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-8 is the SHIPPING image: the base SB8 builds
# from this branch with the eight-seat profile baked in as its serving default (ENV QWEN_C2_PROFILE) and the platform session cap baked as its
# seat count (ENV THATCH_SERVING_SESSION_CAP). Every job serves that one image, so the bytes that pass are the bytes that ship. Each job still
# names its profile explicitly, so none relies on the baked default. A commit that changes a file the image carries needs a new SB8 build and a
# new tag in every template.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-8
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8-gate
C2_GATE_PLAN=staggered
C2_GATE_LENGTHS=4096,8192,16384,24576,32768,49152,60000,120000
C2_GATE_MAX_TOKENS=4096
C2_GATE_JIT=record
